                                                "sense_id": "e6bf08ca-1096-3800-9b61-db9f16bc0b87",
                                                "text": "In the Straits of Malacca one encounters a squall every night; there they are known by the name of Sumatras, crossing as they do from the island bearing that name."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c13326b-171b-335d-9348-c4375291563d",
